title: MikroTik CHR License
agents: mikrotik
catalog: hw/network/mikrotik
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 License state of a MikroTik Cloud Hosted Router (CHR).

 A paid CHR license (p1, p10, p-unlimited) is perpetual. The CHR has
 to reach the MikroTik account server before {deadline-at} to renew
 it. If that fails, the router keeps its license level, but RouterOS
 upgrades and package changes are blocked ({limited-upgrades: yes}).

 {OK}: paid license level. {CRIT}: no license (level {free}, 1 Mbit/s
 upload per interface). {WARN}: renewal failed, upgrades blocked. Both
 states are configurable. Next renewal and renewal deadline are shown
 as details.

 To connect to the MikroTik device a special datasource program is
 used: {MikroTik RouterOS} in Setup > Agents > Other integrations,
 module "License Key (CHR)".

inventory:
 One service on a CHR. RouterBOARD devices are not discovered.
